{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic推出Claude Duet，將其定位為一款主動式AI代理：它會從用户已連接的應用中發現需要處理的事項，在用户開口前發來提醒，也能接手任務並在用户離開設備後繼續工作。產品圍繞Claude Opus 5.5構建，面向工作事務繁雜的專業人士和小企業經營者。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583272.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.144828+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T21:06:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"7e75eef9c60b6ee47805ebaa04027652eed65e0769679701cfd3a71515b5ed2d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}